# Synthetic SWC for SWC2MESH smoke tests and documentation.
# Units: nanometers (typical for neuromorphic / navis SWC exports).
# Coordinates and radii are written unchanged into STL vertex space.
# Many STL viewers assume millimeters — scale down by 1e-6 for mm, or 1e-3 for µm.
# id type x y z radius parent
1 3 0 0 0 500 -1
2 3 5000 0 0 400 1
3 3 10000 0 0 350 2
4 3 15000 5000 0 300 3
5 3 20000 10000 0 250 4
